    owl:allValuesFrom <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation>.
<http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/Stimulus> rdfs:subClassOf 509.
_:n3-2511 a owl:Restriction.
_:n3-2512 owl:inverseOf <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/detects>.
